### Ragas eval (Python offline evaluator) ###
# 全局 *.py 规则会忽略 eval 脚本，此处按需放行
!eval/ragas/*.py
eval/ragas/.venv/
eval/ragas/input/*
!eval/ragas/input/.gitkeep
eval/ragas/output/*
!eval/ragas/output/.gitkeep
!eval/ragas/.env.example
eval/ragas/.env
eval/ragas/__pycache__/

